  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of currently, the only real way to gather the position of each finger from an index controller is to use contact receivers on the fingers. This uses 4-5 contacts per hand and can be difficult to work with. (You could technically use OSC but that eats up a lot of your parameter space and has a low update rate)\nIt would be much easier to work with floats for each finger and would allow for more custom hand gestures when using index controllers.",
